// VALIDATION RULES
// 1. Every player must have a name, pos, team, era, ovr, and source.
// 2. ovr must be 0-99. spd/str/agi/cod/inj/awr must be 0-99.
// 3. pos must be one of the 26 starter slot codes (or DL5/LB4/CB4/SS2/FS2/WR4/P/FB for depth).
// 4. team must be one of the 32 NFL team names.
// 5. era must be a decade string (e.g., "1980s", "2000s").
// 6. xf is optional (null or omitted if no X-factor).
// 7. source must explain how the rating was derived.
// 8. No duplicate players (same name + team).
// 9. Position balance: aim for ~26 players per position across all eras.
// 10. Total players: ~1,200 (current NFL players with -5 era adjustment + historical greats).
